                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "SHKVw",
                      "fill": "#6F665B",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": 820,
                      "content": "Between debugging on Reddit and doom-scrolling Reddit. Between a YouTube tutorial and a YouTube binge. Tomato reads your active window against the intention you typed — and only nudges when you've really drifted. Never blocks. Never shames. An accountability partner that trains your own focus.",
