          "width": 880,
          "fill": "#FFF7D6",
          "cornerRadius": 18,
          "stroke": {
            "align": "inside",
            "thickness": 2,
            "fill": "#E5C16B"
          },
          "layout": "vertical",
          "gap": 16,
          "padding": 32,
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "I75hDh",
              "name": "noteHeader",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "layout": "vertical",
              "gap": 6,
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "Jlohg",
                  "fill": "#7A5A12",
                  "content": "FOR DEVELOPERS",
                  "fontFamily": "Geist Mono",
                  "fontSize": 11,
                  "fontWeight": "600",
                  "letterSpacing": 1.5
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "gRBr9",
                  "fill": "#3D2A05",
                  "content": "Anthropic API Key Flow",
                  "fontFamily": "Newsreader",
                  "fontSize": 28,
                  "fontWeight": "500",
                  "letterSpacing": -0.3
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "Yg68M",
                  "fill": "#6B5512",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "How the BYOK (Bring Your Own Key) onboarding and settings flow should behave.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.45,
                  "fontFamily": "Inter",
                  "fontSize": 13,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "rectangle",
              "id": "MII66",
              "name": "divider1",
              "fill": "#E5C16B",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "height": 1
            },
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "sZpkC",
              "name": "flowSection",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "layout": "vertical",
              "gap": 10,
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "Z5OFcw",
                  "fill": "#7A5A12",
                  "content": "FLOW",
                  "fontFamily": "Geist Mono",
                  "fontSize": 10,
                  "fontWeight": "600",
                  "letterSpacing": 1.5
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "z0OXy",
                  "fill": "#3D2A05",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "1. First launch → Permissions screen (00). User accepts both screen recording + accessibility.\n2. → Onboarding API Key screen (08, NEW). User pastes Anthropic key.\n3. On Continue: validate key by making a cheap test call to /v1/models. If 200 → fetch the live model list from /v1/models, persist key in macOS Keychain (service: \"app.tomato\", account: \"anthropic-key\"), persist default model = cheapest non-deprecated Haiku variant returned. → route to Intent Input (Gwc4H).\n4. From the menu bar tomato icon → Settings panel (09, NEW). User can rotate key or change model at any time.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.55,
                  "fontFamily": "Inter",
                  "fontSize": 13,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "rectangle",
              "id": "fnalH",
              "name": "divider2",
              "fill": "#E5C16B",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "height": 1
            },
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "HQ1Mx",
              "name": "defaultsSection",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "layout": "vertical",
              "gap": 10,
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "o75aVB",
                  "fill": "#7A5A12",
                  "content": "DEFAULTS",
                  "fontFamily": "Geist Mono",
                  "fontSize": 10,
                  "fontWeight": "600",
                  "letterSpacing": 1.5
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "vkeVY",
                  "fill": "#3D2A05",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "• Default model: cheapest Haiku returned by /v1/models (today: claude-haiku-4-5). Do NOT hardcode the model ID — derive from the live list so we automatically pick up newer cheap models.\n• If /v1/models lookup fails after a valid key, fall back to claude-haiku-4-5 and surface a soft warning in Settings.\n• Show price chips ($, $$, $$$) by mapping known model families. Update mapping in one place: src/config/modelPricing.ts.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.55,
                  "fontFamily": "Inter",
                  "fontSize": 13,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "rectangle",
              "id": "bLmUL",
              "name": "divider3",
              "fill": "#E5C16B",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "height": 1
            },
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "M21JF",
              "name": "edgeSection",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "layout": "vertical",
              "gap": 10,
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "VOCEh",
                  "fill": "#7A5A12",
                  "content": "EDGE CASES",
                  "fontFamily": "Geist Mono",
                  "fontSize": 10,
                  "fontWeight": "600",
                  "letterSpacing": 1.5
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "VfEBT",
                  "fill": "#3D2A05",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "• Invalid format: catch client-side before calling Anthropic. Keys must match /^sk-ant-[a-zA-Z0-9_-]{20,}$/. Show inline error, do NOT hit the network.\n• 401/403 from Anthropic: \"That key didn't work — Anthropic rejected it.\" Keep CTA enabled so user can retry.\n• 429 rate limit: \"Anthropic is rate-limiting this key. Try again in a moment.\" Auto-retry once with backoff before showing.\n• Network/offline: \"Couldn't reach Anthropic — check your connection.\" Offer Retry; do NOT clear the entered key.\n• Key revoked AFTER onboarding: detect from any 401 during a session → pause drift summarization, show a non-blocking banner in the HUD linking to Settings. Session timer keeps running so we don't punish the user for our auth issue.\n• User pastes key with whitespace/newlines: trim before validation.\n• User clicks \"Skip for now\": app still works as a plain pomodoro timer. Drift detection + activity summaries are disabled. Show a soft CTA in Settings to add a key later.\n• Keychain access denied (rare): show \"Tomato can't write to your Keychain\" with a Retry button; never silently fall back to plaintext storage.\n• Model deprecated mid-use: if a chosen model 404s at request time, auto-fall-back to default Haiku and surface a one-time toast \"Switched to Claude Haiku 4.5 — your selected model is no longer available.\"\n• Multiple Macs: each install holds its own keychain copy. Do NOT sync the key via iCloud.\n• Telemetry: never log the key or its prefix beyond the last 4 chars (e.g. \"…9F2C\"). Redact in Sentry/Bugsnag.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.55,
                  "fontFamily": "Inter",
                  "fontSize": 13,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "rectangle",
              "id": "Ffjsp",
              "name": "divider4",
              "fill": "#E5C16B",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "height": 1
            },
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "oagMU",
              "name": "privacySection",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "layout": "vertical",
              "gap": 10,
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "NZlYT",
                  "fill": "#7A5A12",
                  "content": "PRIVACY GUARANTEES (must hold)",
                  "fontFamily": "Geist Mono",
                  "fontSize": 10,
                  "fontWeight": "600",
                  "letterSpacing": 1.5
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "SAPUG",
                  "fill": "#3D2A05",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "• Key is stored only in macOS Keychain, never written to disk in plaintext, never sent to our servers.\n• Only TEXTUAL metadata about the user's screen is sent to Anthropic — never raw pixels. Match the wording shown on the splash page exactly.\n• All Anthropic calls go directly from the user's Mac to api.anthropic.com — no Tomato proxy in the loop.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.55,
                  "fontFamily": "Inter",
                  "fontSize": 13,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
